        "x1": 0.9699906837648131,
        "y1": 0.6902570934881602
      },
      "text": "mier de ce mandat, de renouer la",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.6955736004790236,
        "x1": 0.5091449217896175,
        "y1": 0.710807187491669
      },
      "text": "pas lestée par le passé. Nous ne voulions pas en effet continuer",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7103121410766096,
        "y0": 0.6933038011034854,
        "x1": 0.9645233358267652,
        "y1": 0.708537388116131
      },
      "text": "confiance qui doit présider aux rela-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.7138538951069944,
        "x1": 0.5100217924519964,
        "y1": 0.7290874821196398
      },
      "text": "à payer les travaux engagés avant nous, mais au contraire, que",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5248443357412225,
        "y0": 0.7115840957314562,
        "x1": 0.9683348833296744,
        "y1": 0.7268176827441017
      },
      "text": "tions entre le Département et les Jurassiens. Cette confiance et",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.7321341897349651,
        "x1": 0.5045635810081079,
        "y1": 0.7473677767476106
      },
      "text": "chaque euro d’investissement qui nous reste soit consacré à l’avenir.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5248443357412225,
        "y0": 0.729864390359427,
        "x1": 0.968634001673491,
        "y1": 0.7450979773720725
      },
      "text": "cette crédibilité doivent être reconquises pas à pas, et je mets",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.7526843082064836,
        "x1": 0.5092736474270732,
        "y1": 0.7679178952191291
      },
      "text": "2016 sera synonyme de changement profond et d’incertitude",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5248443357412225,
        "y0": 0.7481446849873977,
        "x1": 0.871887374048691,
        "y1": 0.7633782720000432
      },
      "text": "tout mon honneur et mon énergie à les mériter.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.7709646028344543,
        "x1": 0.5081884414201682,
        "y1": 0.7861981898470999
      },
      "text": "nouvelle. Le Jura sera inséré malgré lui dans une nouvelle grande",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.7892449096964299,
        "x1": 0.5089819197505066,
        "y1": 0.8044784967090755
      },
      "text": "région, dont nous ne connaissons pas encore vraiment ni la figure,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8361071170936593,
        "y0": 0.7892448974624251,
        "x1": 0.9644799229309506,
        "y1": 0.8044784844750706
      },
      "text": "Clément PERNOT",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.8075252165584055,
        "x1": 0.5090870185304545,
        "y1": 0.8227588035710509
      },
      "text": "ni les moyens : la loi NOTRe a détricoté nos compétences, par la",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6476502233123979,
        "y0": 0.8097950036999388,
        "x1": 0.9644853931886002,
        "y1": 0.8250285907125843
      },
      "text": "Président du Conseil départemental du Jura",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.8258055234203809,
        "x1": 0.508183029356749,
        "y1": 0.8410391104330265
      },
      "text": "volonté d’un gouvernement qui, ne pouvant nous faire disparaître",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.8440858302823565,
        "x1": 0.44308812721154833,
        "y1": 0.859319417295002
      },
      "text": "totalement, a décidé de nous laisser mourir à petit feu.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
        "y0": 0.8646359365198703,
        "x1": 0.5089130177818141,
        "y1": 0.8798695235325157
      },
      "text": "À ce jour, la survie du département est ébranlée et le sérieux de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04466380261806848,
